=== INTEGRATION CSPROJ REPAIR (pre-existing corruption, required for a green gate) ===
The auto-integration branch had committed TeslaSync.App.Tests.csproj with TWO concatenated <Project> roots: an
upper fragment (lines 1-897) carrying the newest feature-view <Compile> links (incl. DriveHighlightSlide,
DrivingTemperatureStats) but with 3 unclosed <ItemGroup> tags, and a lower, structurally-valid <Project>
(lines 898-1686) carrying an older include set (incl. ChargingTab). MSBuild error MSB4025 blocked any build of
the headless test project (and therefore this gate). The repair collapses the file to the single valid lower
project and recovers the 18 <Compile> links that existed only in the upper fragment (a lossless union of both
sets: 363 unique links, 0 dropped, deduplicated, XML well-formed, ItemGroups balanced 39/39). No conflict
markers were present. This is a faithful resolution of the integration merge, not a scope change.

=== SUMMARY ===
Surface (allowed files): apps/windows/TeslaSync.App/feature-views/SummarySlide/
  - SummarySlide.Model.cs  (WinUI-free: SummarySlideState, YearReviewSummary (tolerant FromJson/ParseNullable
                           incl. nested vehicle), SummarySlideModel, SummaryStat, SummarySlideDisplay,
                           SummarySlideProjection, SummarySlideRegistration, SummarySlideDiagnostics)
  - SummarySlide.cs        (WinUI 3 view: ContentControl rendering the content / empty web branches)
Tests (required by acceptance + gate): apps/windows/TeslaSync.App.Tests/FeatureViews/SummarySlideTests.cs (28 tests)
  + SummarySlide.Model.cs linked into TeslaSync.App.Tests.csproj (headless net10.0 adapter/projection verification).

Web source parity (web/src/features/analytics/components/review/SummarySlide.tsx):
  States reproduced: data -> Content (screenshot card: year + t('yearReview.title') header, vehicle name/model,
    five headline stats, the gas_savings>0 line, the brand footer + the share caption) : Empty (the friendly
    t('yearReview.noDriveData') copy, never a blank box). The web source is presentational (prop data; hooks
    useTranslation + useUnits only), so there is no fetch-driven loading/error/stale/offline branch to reproduce
    -- the parent year-in-review page owns those, exactly as the sibling DriveHighlightSlide/AuditPanel ports document.
  Data sources mapped: useTranslation -> ILocalizer facade; useUnits -> UnitPref (settable Units property; no HTTP in the view).
  Shared components mapped: @/components/data-display AnimatedNumber -> TsAnimatedNumber (count-up, OS reduce-motion aware);
    @/components/motion (framer-motion scale entrance + staggered stats) -> TsFadeIn + TsStaggerContainer; glass card ->
    TsGlassPanel; lucide Car/Zap/Plug/Leaf -> Segoe Fluent glyphs E804/E945/E7E8/E909 (decorative, AccessibilityView.Raw);
    typography -> Caption + tokenized DisplayTokens brushes (no raw hex); savings emerald -> TsColorSuccessBrush token.
  Units: only distance is converted -- convertDistanceFromSI(total_distance_km*1000, unit) -> UnitConverters.DistanceFromSi;
    drives/kWh/charges/kg CO2 are shown in their canonical unit exactly as the web does (no conversion). Math.round on
    gas_savings reproduced (round-half-up). Values grouped with the same en-US formatter TsAnimatedNumber renders. SI is
    read and converted only at the display boundary (Phase-48 contract).
  i18n: yearReview.totalDrives / energyKwh / charges / co2KgSaved / title / savedSummary / screenshot (+ noDriveData for
    the empty branch) resolve through the P1/S10 ILocalizer facade and are present in Strings/{en,ar,he}/Resources.resw;
    no English literals beyond the fallbacks the web t() also passes. savedSummary interpolates the rounded amount via
    string.Format("Saved ${0} vs. gas", ...) matching the catalog's {0} slot.
  Accessibility: composed surface Narrator name in both states (year/title/vehicle/stats/savings, or the empty message);
    decorative stat icons are AccessibilityView.Raw; the empty state is a live region; the savings line carries its own
    emoji-free Narrator name; TextBlocks honour the system font scale; entrance honours OS reduce-motion via TsFadeIn +
    TsStaggerContainer + TsAnimatedNumber.
  Telemetry: SummarySlideDiagnostics emits "view.opened slug=SummarySlide" (PII-safe; never vehicle name/distance/energy/
    savings) on first load.

